---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
pageKey: home
pageStyle: home
description: Yutong Wang studies applied deep learning and AI agents at UC Santa Barbara.
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__copy reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.title }} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {{ site.institution }}</p>
    <div class="hero__identity">
      <div class="hero__avatar"><img src="/assets/images/yutong-portrait.jpg" alt="Yutong Wang at Yosemite National Park" width="900" height="1200" decoding="async"></div>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Yutong<br>Wang</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="hero__intro">I am a master’s student in Electrical and Computer Engineering at UC Santa Barbara. My research interests center on applied deep learning and AI agents—how learning-based systems can perceive, reason, use tools, and act in real-world workflows.</p>
    <div class="hero__links">
      <a class="arrow-link" href="/research/"><span>Explore my research</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.emailHref }}">{{ site.emailDisplay }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figure class="hero__media reveal reveal--delay">
    <img src="/assets/images/UCSB.jpg" alt="Henley Gate at the University of California, Santa Barbara" width="1707" height="1280">
    <figcaption>Henley Gate · UC Santa Barbara</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="selected-work section container" aria-labelledby="research-title">
  <div class="section-heading reveal">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Current work</p>
      <h2 id="research-title">Research</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="arrow-link" href="/research/"><span>View all research</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>

  <div class="publication-list reveal reveal--delay">
    {% for publication in publications %}
      {% if publication.featured %}
        {% include "components/publication-item.njk" %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
